  "changelog": "Skill2Team 1.9.2 delivers improved compliance, context loading, and delivery options for agent-team design.\n\n- Defaults all execution to OpenAI Codex, clarifying differences from direct API model service.\n- Adds startup reminders, emphasizing agent runtime invocation and labeling for API-based requests.\n- Refines context loading: entry skill stays lean, with supporting files loaded strictly on demand based on task.\n- Expands, details, and clarifies routes and delivery modes, with clear separation between design and package phases.\n- Introduces stricter design rules for human-intervention handling, workflow preservation, and package conformance.\n- Improves design/package contract enforcement: non-conformant teams must be regenerated, not patched.",
